OL,3,AKatie Price denies 'any venom' against
OL,4,Aex at his rape trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie Price has denied having "any
OL,7,Fvenom" against her ex-husband at his
OL,8,Frape trial.
OL,10,FKieran Hayler is on trial at Lewes
OL,11,FCrown Court accused of three counts of
OL,12,Frape and one of sexual assault against
OL,13,Fa then-13-year-old girl in West Sussex
OL,14,Fin 2016, all of which he denies.
OL,16,FWhen challenged by defence lawyer
OL,17,FArlette Piercy on her view of her
OL,18,Fex-husband, Price said: "I don't have
OL,19,Fany venom against Kieran, it was
OL,20,Famicable when we split."
